<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0505_T07R0205_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, you broke in?! I’m calling\nthe cops AND my mama.\rLemme tell you a TERRIFYIN’ story...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0505_T07R0205_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">But it ain’t scary while it’s light\nout.\rCome back after dark, OK?\nAtmosphere is EVERYTHING.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0505_T07R0205_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Once upon a time, there was a lil\nboy who got a brand-new Bike...\fHe wanted to ride it right away...\rHe was havin’ so much fun that he\nain’t notice it was\falready dark...\rRidin’ home in the pitch-black\nnight, the Bike slowed down!\rThe pedals got HEAVY!\rThe Bike started slidin’\nbackward like it was bein’ dragged\fby somebody!\rLike the Bike was cursed and\ntryin’ to drag him into the void!\r...\r...\rSHRIEEEEK!\rThe boy was ridin’ UPHILL on\nCycling Road!\r...\nBa-dum, ba-dum!\rFor listenin’ so patient, you can\ntake this--Spell Tag!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0505_T07R0205_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spell Tag boost Ghost moves.\rIt won’t slow your Bike, so don’t\nworry! Or will it? *spooky noises*</language>
	</row>
</body>
